      ],
      "category": "cpu_saturation",
      "date": "2026-04-22",
      "snippet": "## Summary A regex in ad targeting went quadratic on long keyword lists. Ad CPU sat at 97% of its limit with heavy throttling, p95 rose to 1.5s and frontend page latency breached its SLO. A small share of ad calls hit DEADLINE_EXCEEDED. ## Resolution Scaled ad to 4 replicas, then fixed the regex. ## Lessons - CPU at limit + `CPUThrottlingHigh` + latency on one service with no errors elsewhere = sa\u2026",
      "score": 11.874
    },
