      "snippet": "## Summary Recommendation was OOMKilled every ~7 minutes for two hours. Each restart dropped in-flight requests, so frontend saw periodic bursts of 5xx. Memory grew linearly from ~45% to 100% of the limit between restarts (sawtooth). ## Root cause An in-process cache keyed by product-id list had no eviction. The `recommendationCacheFailure` flag reproduces this. ## Resolution Restarted the deploym\u2026",
